Purpose
-------
This is a collection of various helper scripts that may help when working with
kernel.org infrastructure.

Contributing
------------
Please send any contributions in the form of patches to the following address:
 - tools@linux.kernel.org

Submissions must be made under the terms of the Linux Foundation certificate of
contribution and should include a Signed-off-by: line. Please read the DCO
file for full legal definition of what that implies.

Support
-------
Please send support requests to tools@linux.kernel.org.
